The room around you is surrounded by windows which were not visible from
without the room.  Through them you can see into the world, in all its 
aspects.  The room is simple and sparsely decorated, with a small polished
sphere in the center, drawing focus.  Looking more closely at this sphere, you
notice that all reality is not merely reflected in this sphere, but a 
complete mirror image of creation exists within it in all directions, even 
to the most infinitesemal detail.  As you look deeper into the sphere, you are
able to gaze at any area of the world that you desire, and the image moves 
with your thoughts so as to show you more of what your gaze rests upon.  
Surrounding the sphere is a fountain which cascades out to colored pools which
seem as sundry gates to Ol'en, the world that exists beyond the veil.

